  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Inclusive quality education for children in the most vulnerable situations in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education in the Sudan has been underfunded by many years but the sector has severely deteriorated in the last two years with the ongoing war in Sudan disproportionately affecting children.The action aims to create a safe and inclusive learning environment for children, specially refugees, IDPs, disabled and children out of school.  It includes four mutually reinforcing components, designed to:Increase safe and inclusive access to and retention in education among crisis-affected vulnerable children and youth Improve the quality of teaching and learning in a crisis contextImprove student attendance and nutrition, providing nutritious school meals using locally produced food items.Advance access to quality preventive and responsive protection services</narrative>
  </description>
